{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541398-lairs-chamber-paths-and-burrows","id":541398,"title":"Lairs, Chamber, Paths and Burrows!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-05T10:13:31-07:00","id":541398,"title":"Lairs, Chamber, Paths and Burrows!","content":"I have a number of questions on Lairs and related stuff and I figured a single thread might make sense:<br /> <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Min /Max size of a chamber? A High School was mentioned as an example. So I assume that any large building (office/factory/apartment)would work. A single house would be much smaller than that so I guess it would be fine, but how about a short suburban street with 5 to 10 houses? A cruise ship? Generally what is the range we are working with?</li> <li>Can action happen on/in burrows? Or is it just a narrative type bridge between two scenes(\u201cAnd we walked the dirt road to the High School\u201d). They are described as pathways between chambers not just door. So can the Soul engage Heroes/visitors on the road(burrow) between the haunted High School(Chamber) and flooded factory(chamber)? Can my Beast inflict lair traits in the burrow?</li> <li>Can someone enter a Real world location once it is has become an endpoint for an ongoing primordial path? I\u2019m using a High school as link to my lair, can cops arrive and enter the High school from the real world and end up in my ongoing Primordial Path event? Will the signal from burglar alarm/phone call in a building undergoing a primordial path actually reach outside?</li> <li>One can create a primordial path from a chamber to a \u201clike\u201d location. Do we have a limit on that. Does having on High School or McDonalds, give me access(With a possibly difficult role) to all the Highschools or Mc Donalds in the world? My thought is that I would actually have had to have been there before. But from the modifier table maybe just wanting a \u201cMcDonalds in Russia\u201d or \u201cHigh School in Chicago\u201d might be enough.</li> <li>A limit on the number of burrows? How interlinked could I make my chambers? Daisy chain or Cat\u2019s Cradle.</li> <li>Does an outsider have to find the burrows between chambers? \u201cOne of my chambers is an apartment building. The closet door in one of them leads to the next chamber\u201d. Maze trait add a role to navigate out of an area so I suppose the lack of Maze does not require a roll(Barring other traits)?</li> <li>Creating a chamber in a way creates a dream(astral?) copy of location. How much detail is kept? I create a chamber from my local public library. Does my Lair suddenly have a lot more reading material? Or are the books now just blank/jibberish? I create one from an apartment building. Can I know go through the astral copy of the closets and find what the apartment owners been hiding or are they now made generic?</li> </ol><br /> <br /> Thanks for your help thoughts and ideas in advance.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2161-nadir","name":"Nadir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2161_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T11:35:59-07:00","id":541523,"title":"","content":"Oh, I got one too: When a beast merges with their soul, do they use the simplified dream traits or the usual 9?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T12:34:34-07:00","id":541575,"title":"","content":"Dream Traits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T13:11:39-07:00","id":541622,"title":"","content":"I can't answer all the questions for sure, though here are my takes on what I think on some.<br /> <br /> 1. Whatever makes narrative sense for your Soul, go with. I think if you're outside in a road, the road makes up the Chamber. If you're inside a building, that would make up the Chamber, rather than the street it is in. You should think about Lair Traits when making a Chamber and you can't make them up willy nilly either, so limits are in place.<br /> 2. I'd allow it, if it adds something to the story, why not?<br /> 3. So, you're making a link to a highschool as your Lair... That seems fine in the rules. I'd like a bit of clarification on which side 'the external end' of a Pathway means myself... I've gathered it as the end that is wanted to be reached from in respect to the Lair. Either way, yeah... You can do that, though it'll help some if the location has Lair Tilts in effect. You still get a -2 penalty then to the roll and a Pathway only remains open for Resolve rounds. So it's more a temporary measure than making something permanent. That comes into filling Chamber slots, though that in itself takes quite a bit of effort and they're located in the Primordial Dreaming rather than elsewhere.<br /> 4. I'd throw in a -3 penalty for that, along with whatever modifiers are going already (including -3 for external end to the material world).<br /> 5. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Every Chamber in a Beast\u2019s Lair has at least one Burrow, leading to another Chamber. Beasts<br /> may <b>add additional Burrows by paying one Satiety each time</b>, and may re-map any or all of their<br /> Burrows by spending a point of Willpower as long as no one is currently using the Burrows<br /> being changed. </div> </div> </div>6. I don't think so. Seems general intruders may tend to follow a Beast when a Primordial Pathway is open. That seems the way most humans would get in anyway.<br /> 7. I think you can have some fluff from making a Chamber, but I'd disallow anything that essentially gives your character Merit dot equivalents, like a library is fine to base a Chamber on, though I dislike the idea of a Beast then gaining a library Merit due to that. I'd say the Soul has no want to read over it's Hunger or something. It's also kind of a dream/astral interpretation of the original location, I don't think rooting around your Chamber apartment's underwear drawers for secrets from the specific owner the Chamber was based off will bring up anything... ^__^;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T14:17:24-07:00","id":541683,"title":"","content":"Begotten Dick Move #107: Make a Lair entirely made up of identical, white cubic chambers, with Burrows to 4 other identical cubic chambers, and so on to taste. Make the walls and floors impossible to mark on. Giggle uncontrollably.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T01:27:53-07:00","id":542386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541398-lairs-chamber-paths-and-burrows?p=541683#post541683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Begotten Dick Move #107: Make a Lair entirely made up of identical, white cubic chambers, with Burrows to 4 other identical cubic chambers, and so on to taste. Make the walls and floors impossible to mark on. Giggle uncontrollably.</div> </div> </div> </div>Taking the Maze trait is required for this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T01:55:27-07:00","id":542391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/541398-lairs-chamber-paths-and-burrows?p=541683#post541683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Begotten Dick Move #107: Make a Lair entirely made up of identical, white cubic chambers, with Burrows to 4 other identical cubic chambers, and so on to taste. Make the walls and floors impossible to mark on. Giggle uncontrollably.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I've seen that movie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T03:13:56-07:00","id":542414,"title":"","content":"Awesome Cube reference, but wow would that take ages with the Satiety you'd have to spend! I imagine the Soul getting increasingly annoyed at the Beast using their feeding to construct something like that... xD<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T09:37:55-07:00","id":542693,"title":"","content":"Ok, here's something I'm not too clear on: The book says that when a Primordial Pathway closes everyone gets dumped in the external end. Does that include the beast? That's what happens in the example immediately after, but I was wondering if they could just choose to stay on the Dream end if they want. Otherwise, do they need to go through a burrow before they can use the lair to go anywhere else?<br /> <br /> Also, how does dream health work when you're not in your lair? Is it tracked separately to the regular kind? What happens when you merge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3166,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","user":"Elfive","date":". 06-06-2015, 01:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}